{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/c342a66fb616801cb248202b2190f8ed.poster.avif?t=1773457787\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/c342a66fb616801cb248202b2190f8ed.webm?t=1773457787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Liminal City: Axiom of Maria is a 3D Metroidvania action-adventure game that blends acrobatic traversal, puzzle-solving, exploration, storytelling, swordplay, and meticulously designed boss encounters. In a world where humanity has nearly vanished due to population collapse, reality and the unconscious are reversed for AI\u2014Beyond, the virtual realm where the deceased are backed up, serves as their reality, while the physical world becomes their unconscious. To AI, humans have become like fleeting monsters in our dreams\u2014beings that wander through AI's unconscious.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/5d20fffc2c8ab5f1862ce6ddc18fcc18.poster.avif?t=1773457787\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/5d20fffc2c8ab5f1862ce6ddc18fcc18.webm?t=1773457787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/5d20fffc2c8ab5f1862ce6ddc18fcc18.mp4?t=1773457787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With humanity nearly gone, most institutions in South Korea have been replaced by AI, which now wage invisible wars\u2014assimilating each other and competing for control over electricity.<br>Kay arrives in the sealed COEX, controlled by the Trade Association AI, to meet a hacker named Kim Qyuri, who may have the key to finding Kay's missing husband. <br>Kim Qyuri is being pursued by multiple factions, including AISOC. It is believed that she took refuge within the Trade Association to evade them, but as the story unfolds, the truth gradually reveals itself to be something else entirely.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3D Metroidvania Exploration</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/254edb50e21730183bd942cd1ddd5a26.poster.avif?t=1773457787\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/254edb50e21730183bd942cd1ddd5a26.webm?t=1773457787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/254edb50e21730183bd942cd1ddd5a26.mp4?t=1773457787\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Navigate with a top-down map, acquiring new abilities to access previously unreachable areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast and Fluid Combat</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/5fdbd566019f8934b04992f026ea004d.poster.avif?t=1773457787\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/5fdbd566019f8934b04992f026ea004d.webm?t=1773457787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Combine evasive maneuvers, flanking attacks, time manipulation, blade throws, and kicks to defeat enemies.\u00a0Hack enemies to force them into self-destruction, using them to take out other foes or clear obstacles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tightly Designed Boss Battles</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/b333c64ccfc288e10af93642a2b8214c.poster.avif?t=1773457787\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/b333c64ccfc288e10af93642a2b8214c.webm?t=1773457787\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Use newly acquired abilities to overcome powerful bosses.\u00a0Victory requires more than just dodging and attacking\u2014analyze enemy patterns and exploit their weaknesses to survive.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3397260?t=1773457787","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773457787","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/5edd90d67bbc3e09edf65af5eb7984ec2cac488d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773457787","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/5edd90d67bbc3e09edf65af5eb7984ec2cac488d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773457787","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3614290,"description":""}],"detailed_