ight help\u2014guided only by a voice you may not trust.","steam_appid":3397260,"support_info":{"email":"contact@ganzheitstudio.com","url":"https://ganzheitstudio.com/"},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong>, Korean, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":"https://ganzheitstudio.com/liminal-city-aom-c1/"}